{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobxKBES2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんってどんな人？"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob4leTQ0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはアイドル唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobYKvGkY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これもアイドル唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobswAuQQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはスーパーアイドル唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob5tzF5R.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは「さすがに撮りすぎちゃう？」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "のバラエティ唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "基本私に向けてくれる顔はこっちかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもライブで目が合うと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キラキラ笑顔で見つめてくれる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特にいつかのBACKS LIVE！！の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何ラブの1A？の手をパンパンするところの唯衣ちゃんとペアでやってたあの時の表情忘れられないな〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobAyFIkZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはハイセンス唯衣ちゃん（イジってます）"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobEZrHaI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはいのちゅけの唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobCfMe9A.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは妹唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob78cKC9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんの頭って触りたくなるよね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpWBuuQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは外番組一緒だと心強い唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「くりぃむナンタラ」さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何度も一緒に出演させていただいたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「太田上田」さんも一緒に出演させていただけて嬉しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の上田さんへの愛の熱弁も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも真剣に聞いてくれて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと上田さんも沼のこと好きだよ！って"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも言ってくれて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まるで学生時代によくある"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "友達が背中押してくれるあれで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しかったな〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobsYTJ0B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpVtZGS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobYTuKOd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobPYrOIr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobdF3Msf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobyaF62s.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobvtjx7B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツは本当に青春だ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "必死に駆け抜けてきた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobISE7wX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはやりきったってスッキリした顔の唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/moblTP01x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も唯衣ちゃんへの気持ちぜーんぶ詰め込んだ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひサクラミーツみてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "バラエティプロで面白すぎる唯衣ちゃんも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブでのイケ散らかし唯衣ちゃんも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "疲れてる時赤ちゃんみたいな唯衣ちゃんも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜーんぶ好きだった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業おめでとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寂しいよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後に"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobKkftdj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは世界一可愛い唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯一無二の最高のセレモニーだったよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃん大好き"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あきぽ🐟"}], "source": "official"}